{"route":"/karnal/services-residential-interior-design","city":"karnal","nested":false,"meta":{"og":{"type":"website","site_name":"9th-Corner","title":"Residential Interior Design in Karnal | 9th Corner","description":"Residential interior design in Karnal by 9th Corner for flats, villas and builder floors: layouts, kitchens, wardrobes and lighting done right.","url":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/services-residential-interior-design","image":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/og-default.jpg","image:width":"1200","image:height":"630"},"twitter":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Residential Interior Design in Karnal | 9th Corner","description":"Residential interior design in Karnal by 9th Corner for flats, villas and builder floors: layouts, kitchens, wardrobes and lighting done right.","image":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/og-default.jpg"},"title":"Residential Interior Design in Karnal | 9th Corner","robots":"index, follow","author":"9th-Corner","publisher":"9th-Corner","google-site-verification":"bFDxjFr1uDW3hEQ7YEzagKY9ZLzkrW1k1vtMcyQahyE","description":"Residential interior design in Karnal by 9th Corner for flats, villas and builder floors: layouts, kitchens, wardrobes and lighting done right.","keywords":"Residential Interior Design in Karnal, Best residential interior designers in Karnal, Affordable residential interior designers in Karnal, Luxury residential interior design Karnal, Modern residential interior designers in Karnal, Residential home interior design Karnal, 2BHK residential interior designers in Karnal, 3BHK residential interior design experts, Apartment interior designers in Karnal, Villa interior designers in Karnal, Residential renovation designers in Karnal, Contemporary residential interior design Karnal, Turnkey residential interior designers in Karnal, Residential space planning experts in Karnal, Residential interior decorators in Karnal, Custom home interior design Karnal, Budget-friendly residential interior design services in Karnal,","theme-color":"#0f141f","canonical":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/services-residential-interior-design"},"jsonLd":["{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"LocalBusiness\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\",\"name\":\"9th Corner\",\"alternateName\":[\"Ninth Corner\",\"9th-Corner\"],\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\",\"image\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/logo.avif\",\"logo\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/logo.avif\",\"description\":\"As expert residential interior designers in Karnal, we specialize in creating homes that reflect your personality, lifestyle, and taste. Every residence is unique, and our goal is to design spaces that are not only aesthetically stunning but also comfortable\",\"telephone\":\"+91-9310582834\",\"email\":\"ninthcorner83@gmail.com\",\"priceRange\":\"$$$\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Pearls Best Heights I, 808, Netaji Subhash Place, Pitampura\",\"addressLocality\":\"Delhi\",\"postalCode\":\"110034\",\"addressRegion\":\"Delhi\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"City\",\"name\":\"Karnal\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.facebook.com/ninthcornerINC\",\"https://www.instagram.com/9thcorner.interiors/\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/9th-corner-int/\",\"https://youtube.com/@9thcorner\"]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Karnal\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Residential Interior Design in Karnal\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/services-residential-interior-design\"}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#website\",\"name\":\"9th Corner\",\"alternateName\":\"Ninth Corner\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"}}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What does residential interior design in Karnal cover?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Full-home planning, kitchens, wardrobes, bathrooms, ceilings, lighting, flooring, furniture and décor for independent houses, kothis and apartments.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you design one floor now and another later?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. We can plan the whole house and complete one floor first, so the later floors follow the same style.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you include a puja room and guest rooms?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Puja rooms, guest bedrooms and spaces for visiting family are planned as part of the home, not left for later.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why start residential interior design before construction ends?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Planning early lets us fix electrical points, plumbing and furniture sizes before plastering and flooring, which avoids breaking finished work.\"}}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Residential Interior Design in Karnal, Haryana\",\"serviceType\":\"Residential Interior Design\",\"description\":\"Residential interior design in Karnal by 9th Corner for flats, villas and builder floors: layouts, kitchens, wardrobes and lighting done right.\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/services-residential-interior-design\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Karnal, Haryana\"}}"],"preloads":[],"html":"<!-- CITY-EXPANSION -->\n    <style>\n        /* New Warm & Elegant Theme Colors */\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #f4f1ee; /* Warm Off-White */\n            --text-color: #5a5349; /* Warm Gray/Brown Body Text */\n            --heading-color: #4a433a; /* Darker Warm Gray/Brown Headings */\n            --accent-color: #8b8173; /* Muted Khaki/Taupe Accent */\n            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n            /* Existing non-color variables kept for structure */\n            --shadow-subtle: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            --border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* General Styles */\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        b, strong {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Hero Section --- */\n        .hero-section {\n            background-image: url('/img/project/dr-ak-jain-model-town/dr-ak-jain-model-town/59.avif'); \n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center center;\n            position: relative; \n            overflow: hidden;\n            min-height: 400px;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 80px 20px 60px;\n            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;\n            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section .container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .hero-section h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 54px);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            text-shadow: none;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Content & Philosophy --- */\n        .content-wrap {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .intro-text, .philosophy-box {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .intro-text h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            line-height: 1.25;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p {\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Services Grid --- */\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .service-card.full-width,\n        .service-card:nth-child(3),\n        .service-card:nth-child(4) {\n            grid-column: 1 / -1;\n        }\n        .service-card {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n        }\n        .service-card h3 {\n            font-size: 24px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .service-card p {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .service-card p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n        .service-card ul {\n            padding-left: 20px;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n        }\n        .service-card li {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Why Choose Us --- */\n        .why-choose-us {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-us h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto 30px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro p {\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .reason-list {\n            list-style: none;\n            padding: 0;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n        .reason-list li {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-color);\n            font-size: 15px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .reason-list strong {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message {\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            text-decoration: underline;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        /* --- FAQ Section --- */\n        .faq-section {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .faq-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .faq-list {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .faq-item {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .faq-q {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .faq-a {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Learn More Button */\n        .learn-more-wrap {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 35px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 14px 38px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.3);\n            letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn:hover {\n            background-color: var(--heading-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(74, 67, 58, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Closing Section --- */\n        .closing-section {\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .closing-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .closing-section p {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto 15px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n        .closing-section p a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Work Done / Project Showcase Gallery Carousel --- */\n        .work-gallery-section {\n            margin-top: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .gallery-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n        .gallery-header h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-header p {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            max-width: 750px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 15px 0 25px;\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            width: max-content;\n            animation: infiniteGalleryScroll 30s linear infinite;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:hover .gallery-carousel-track,\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:active .gallery-carousel-track {\n            animation-play-state: paused;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 25px;\n            padding-right: 25px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card {\n            width: 320px;\n            max-width: 340px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.2);\n            transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n            border-color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 240px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            background-color: #e5e0d8;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            transform: scale(1.08);\n        }\n        @keyframes infiniteGalleryScroll {\n            0% {\n                transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: translate3d(-25%, 0, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation: none;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n                overflow-x: auto;\n                -webkit-mask-image: none;\n                mask-image: none;\n            }\n        }        /* Mobile Responsiveness */\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n            .hero-section {\n                padding: 60px 16px 40px;\n                border-radius: 0;\n            }\n            .content-wrap.container {\n                padding-left: 0;\n                padding-right: 0;\n                padding-top: 25px;\n                padding-bottom: 25px;\n            }\n            .intro-text {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 35px;\n            }\n            .intro-text h2 {\n                font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);\n                line-height: 1.22;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n            }\n            .intro-text p {\n                font-size: 16px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                padding: 26px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                overflow: hidden;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box h2 {\n                margin: 0 0 22px;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 7vw, 2.25rem);\n                line-height: 1.18;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p {\n                width: 100%;\n                margin: 0 0 20px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: left;\n                text-indent: 0;\n                font-size: 17px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                word-break: normal;\n                hyphens: none;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n                margin-bottom: 0;\n            }\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 20px;\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n            .gallery-card {\n                width: 280px;\n            }\n            .gallery-img-wrap {\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-group {\n                gap: 18px;\n                padding-right: 18px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation-duration: 22s;\n            }\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                padding: 25px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n            }\n            .process-card-row {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 767px) {\n            .intro-text,\n            .philosophy-box,\n            .services-grid,\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section,\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 40px);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Residential Interior Design in Karnal, Haryana</h1>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- MAIN CONTENT WRAPPER -->\n    <div class=\"container content-wrap\">\n\n        <!-- INTRO -->\n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            <h2>Family Homes Across Karnal</h2>\n            <p>Our residential interior design in Karnal creates homes that serve as a true reflection of your personality, lifestyle, and comfort needs. From modern luxury apartments to expansive private villas, our architectural designs combine high-end aesthetics with functional brilliance, utilizing the latest trends to transform every house into a soulful home.</p>\n            <p>Homes in Karnal are often shared by large families, with grandparents, parents and children under one roof. Plots are bigger than in Delhi, so there is room for spacious living, but also a need for good planning so every corner is used well. Our residential interior design work brings comfort, storage and a fresh look to Karnal homes of every size.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PHILOSOPHY / SERVICE OVERVIEW -->\n        <div class=\"philosophy-box\">\n            <h2>Personalized and Functional Spaces</h2>\n            <p>\"Our design process centers on the core of the home: living rooms that invite conversation, ergonomic kitchens for the modern chef, and serene bedrooms that prioritize rest. We optimize every square inch for usability and style, incorporating high-quality materials and intelligent spatial layouts.\"</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SERVICE CATEGORIES GRID (4 CARDS) -->\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Large Joint Family Homes</h3>\n                <p>For joint families, the heart of the plan is one large family room near the kitchen, with private bedrooms and sitting areas for each branch of the family. Kitchens are large and practical, with space for several people to cook together and storage for bulk grains and supplies.</p><p>Guest rooms and a proper drawing room are planned for the many visitors Karnal homes receive.</p><p>A ground-floor bedroom with an attached bathroom is often the most useful room for elderly parents.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Apartments and Nuclear Family Homes</h3>\n                <p>In the newer apartments and smaller homes, residential interior design focuses on smart storage, flexible furniture and good lighting. Rooms are planned so they can change as children grow or parents move in.</p><p>Built-in study desks and bookshelves give school-going children a quiet place to work.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>Comfort Through the Seasons</h3>\n                <p>Karnal homes need to stay cool in May and warm in January. We plan ceiling fans, efficient AC units, heaters and insulated curtains, and place beds and seating away from cold walls. Bathrooms get geysers sized for winter use. Terraces and verandas are designed for sitting in the winter sun, a favourite family habit.</p><p>Dust from the fields and roads is part of life here, so we prefer floors and shutters that can be wiped clean in minutes.</p><p><b>Tailored Aesthetics:</b> Developing a unique visual language for your home that balances contemporary trends with timeless design principles.</p><p><b>Spatial Optimization:</b> Engineering floor plans that maximize natural light, ventilation, and storage, ensuring your home feels spacious and remains organized.</p><p><b>Curated Finishes:</b> Residential interior design with a meticulous selection of premium woods, stones, and fabrics that offer both durability and a high-luxury tactile experience.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>How We Design Your Home</h3>\n                <p>Our designers drive up to Karnal for the first meeting, usually on a day when most of the family is home. We measure, take photos and list what each person wants changed. Back in Delhi, the residential interior design work takes shape as floor plans, 3D views and costs for every room.</p><p>Once you sign off, a site supervisor based in Karnal runs the work day to day, and the design team returns at set stages to inspect.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->\n        <section class=\"why-choose-us\">\n            <h2>Residential Interior Design Planned for Every Generation</h2>\n            <div class=\"why-choose-intro\">\n                <p>We understand that a Karnal home is often shared by several generations. We plan for each of them, so the home works for everyone.</p>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"reason-list\">\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Vast Experience in Delhi’s Diverse Residential Architecture</strong>\n                    Experience with homes across Delhi NCR and Haryana.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Design Narratives Precision-Tailored to Your Family's Lifestyle</strong>\n                    Designs shaped around your family's way of life.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Hassle-Free Project Management from Initial 3D Concept to Final Handover</strong>\n                    One team accountable from first drawing to last fitting.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Space for Every Generation</strong>\n                    Shared rooms and private corners.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Ready for Winter</strong>\n                    Heating, geysers and sunny sit-outs.\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"final-cta-message\">\n                <p>Ready to build your sanctuary? Partner with Karnal’s trusted residential specialists to bring your dream home to life.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- WORK DONE / PORTFOLIO SHOWCASE -->\n        <section class=\"work-gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-header\">\n                <h2>Our Completed Projects in Haryana</h2>\n                <p>Homes from our Haryana portfolio, in Bhiwani and Sonipat.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-carousel-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"gallery-carousel-track\">\n                    <div class=\"gallery-carousel-group\">\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-vijay-singh-sonipat/mr-vijay-singh-sonipat/2.avif\" alt=\"Residence in Sonipat, Haryana by 9th Corner\" title=\"Sonipat Residence\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-umesh-jain-bhivani/mr-umesh-jain-bhivani/1.avif\" alt=\"Home in Bhiwan