       </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>A Home Your Whole Family Loves</h2>\n            <p>A good family home brings people together and gives each person room to breathe. Thoughtful residential interior design gets that balance right in houses of every size.</p><p>Building or renovating in Karnal? <a href=\"/karnal/contact\">Request a home visit from 9th Corner</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}